"status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A serious girl, which is always worried about her friends. Her hobby is photography, so she always carries a camera."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55568"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑張り屋で真面目な幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなことでも真面目に考えて真剣に取り組み、ベストを尽くす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が先頭に立って責任を背負い込もうとしてしまう、損な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性分が災いして、過去に主人公と起こしたある事件での失敗を心のどこかでいつも気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"写真撮影が趣味で、いつもカメラを持ち歩いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分がどういう人間であったかを記録するための『生きた証』を残し続けていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12291","sourceWorkId":"20891","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑張り屋で真面目な幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなことも真面目に考えて真剣に取り組み、ベストを尽くす。自分が先頭に立って責任を背負い込もうとしてしまう、損な性格。そんな性分が災いして、過去に主人公と起こしたとある事件での失敗を心のどこかでいつも気にしている。写真撮影が趣味で、いつもカメラを持ち歩いている。自分がどういう人間であったかを記録するための『生きた証』を残し続けていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46692"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b3b953b366ed5dc905cb4024c69a06ac45bb2990a8e10a64c5f4626bd4ec4d0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd5ce7790953e876acbb49d7b58ed453ffcab60455ac6a9d8d951c5e720e2b19.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高田初美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116087:46692:5052:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55569","characterName":"小高 柚月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46693","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116087"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12292"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55569"},"originalCharacterName":"小高 柚月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuzuki is a mood maker, always ready to help."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55569"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然ボケで変に前向きな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、一人の人間として責任の取りようがない大きな事件を起こしてしまった過去を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その影響からか、人類は絶滅した方がいいのではないかという考えを持ち、出会う人に本気で去勢を勧めるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ムードメーカー的な存在で、物怖じしない＋前向きというポジティブの塊。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12292","sourceWorkId":"20891","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然ボケで変に前向きな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、一人の人間として責任の取りようがない大きな事件を起こしてしまった過去を持つ。その影響からか、人類は絶滅した方がいいのではないかという考えを持ち、出会う人に本気で去勢を勧めるようになる。ムードメーカー的な存在で、物怖じしない＋前向きというポジティブの塊。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46693"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edb40e5e4266d592734ff0aaca9e5af6ec1658c22b654587470016c2673e87aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7aa75bb62a4deb21fbe1ad0d46c1e01843c78d4210d9dcbbf6b728e37c6ea4b4.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"門脇舞以","creatorId":"vndb:s440","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s440","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s440","name":"門脇 舞以","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116087:46693:4402:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55570","characterName":"土織 キス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46694","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116087"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12293"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55570"},"originalCharacterName":"土織 キス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"From her birth she has been hospitalized for a long time. She is familiar with electricity, machinery and the like. Has an noisy hobby of creating railguns. Much of her knowledge is rather useless for everyday life however. She does not handle erotic talk well and will usually turn red and stiffen. She get’s especially flustered if it’s directed towards her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55570"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間から外れてしまったかもしれない少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれてからずっと入院続きで、体中をいろいろと改造されたために、一部の人々からは『人間外』という烙印を押されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"電気や機械のことに詳しく、レールガンの作成という物騒な趣味を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他にも原付の盗み方など、およそ日常生活の役に立たない知識や技術に詳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチな話が苦手で、聞かされると真っ赤になって硬直してしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12293","sourceWorkId":"20891","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間から外れてしまったかもしれない少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれてからずっと入院続きで、体中をいろいろと改造されたために、一部の人々からは『人間外』という烙印を押されている。電気や機械のことに詳しく、レールガンの作成という物騒な趣味を持つ。他にも原付の盗み方など、およそ日常生活の役に立たない知識や技術に詳しい。エッチな話が苦手で、聞かされると真っ赤になって硬直してしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/801a348285e09945023b94ebbb06debbdf1856880524a92335ab718724fbaa5a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6d083985b768de105df87fdd3cc481d45f3282013b0718127111b5ad629b1676.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"種﨑敦美","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116087:46694:7575:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55571","characterName":"佐々木 沙織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46695","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116087"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12294"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55571"},"originalCharacterName":"佐々木 沙織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"It seems that she has committed a murder, according to the rumors. The reason of that does not know even Saori -- due to amnesia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55571"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"猟奇殺人鬼かもしれない女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記録の上では殺人を犯しているらしいが、真偽は誰にもわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その理由は、沙織自身も答えを持たない――記憶喪失が原因。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"殺人にためらいがなさそうな言動はよく見せるが、果たして……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の大きなおっぱいをどうやって芸術的に揺らすか、ということに並々ならぬこだわりを見せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12294","sourceWorkId":"20891","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"猟奇殺人鬼かもしれない女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記録の上では殺人を犯しているらしいが、真偽は誰にもわからない。その理由は、沙織自身も答えを持たない——記憶喪失が原因。殺人にためらいがなさそうな言動はよく見せるが、果たして……。自分の大きなおっぱいをどうやって芸術的に揺らすか、ということに並々ならぬこだわりを見せる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46695"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5ddfa0c3bb20fb56892ec99786c57e7745963dddbe660b00f63f5ba122dba274.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1acb275fe5654c761848582224cb19a23c7e5a21aa2785a741f82bb4f1542a90.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"v